{{!
    @template theme_nit/navbar_custom_menu

    The site's own links (الرئيسية / الدورات / من نحن / اتصل بنا) shown as titles
    across the navbar. Every row comes from Site administration → Appearance →
    Advanced theme settings → Custom menu items; the renderer that reads that
    setting is theme_nit\output\core_renderer::navbar_custom_menu().

    A line indented with `-` in the setting becomes a dropdown under its parent,
    drawn with the shared navbar panel look (.nit-navbar-dropdown).

    Hidden below the `md` breakpoint: on a phone these same links are already in
    the drawer that the burger opens.

    Every label is written TWICE — once as `.nit-navbar-link-text`, once as an
    aria-hidden `.nit-navbar-link-ghost` stacked on top of it. The ghost is drawn
    invisibly at the heaviest weight the link can ever take, which is what stops
    the bar twitching sideways when an administrator picks the "Bold" hover or
    active shape for a brand group. See `.nit-navbar-link-label` in
    scss/components/_navbar.scss; on a group that uses no bold the ghost measures
    the same as the label and costs nothing.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * items - [{text, url, title, isactive, haschildren, children:[{text, url, title}]}]

    Example context (json):
    {
        "items": [
            {"text": "الرئيسية", "url": "https://example.com/", "isactive": true},
            {"text": "الدورات", "url": "https://example.com/local/nit_category/search.php?q="}
        ]
    }
}}
<ul class="nit-navbar-links navbar-nav d-none d-md-flex align-items-center mb-0 me-3">
    {{#items}}
        <li class="nav-item {{#haschildren}}dropdown{{/haschildren}}">
            {{^haschildren}}
                <a class="nav-link nit-navbar-link{{#isactive}} active{{/isactive}}"
                   href="{{{url}}}"
                   {{#title}}title="{{title}}"{{/title}}
                   {{#isactive}}aria-current="page"{{/isactive}}><span class="nit-navbar-link-label"><span class="nit-navbar-link-text">{{{text}}}</span><span class="nit-navbar-link-ghost" aria-hidden="true">{{{text}}}</span></span></a>
            {{/haschildren}}
            {{#haschildren}}
                <a class="nav-link nit-navbar-link dropdown-toggle{{#isactive}} active{{/isactive}}"
                   href="{{{url}}}"
                   id="nit-navbar-link-{{moremenuid}}"
                   data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
                   role="button"
                   aria-haspopup="true"
                   aria-expanded="false"
                   {{#title}}title="{{title}}"{{/title}}><span class="nit-navbar-link-label"><span class="nit-navbar-link-text">{{{text}}}</span><span class="nit-navbar-link-ghost" aria-hidden="true">{{{text}}}</span></span></a>
                <div class="dropdown-menu nit-navbar-dropdown" aria-labelledby="nit-navbar-link-{{moremenuid}}">
                    {{#children}}
                        {{^divider}}
                            <a class="dropdown-item" href="{{{url}}}" {{#title}}title="{{title}}"{{/title}}>{{{text}}}</a>
                        {{/divider}}
                    {{/children}}
                </div>
            {{/haschildren}}
        </li>
    {{/items}}
</ul>
